// AGENCY OST — 11 · War Room
// ACT II. Screens wall-to-wall; the org mobilizes. The Rebel Path mold:
// slow, brooding, enormous space — a mid-low staccato riff that keeps
// stopping dead, a huge half-time snare, and a low choir of dread.
// The silence between riff hits IS the menace.
//
// FORM (92 BPM · 1 cycle = 1 bar · 64 bars ≈ 2:47 · loops):
//   intro   8  e1  drone + low choir; the room goes quiet
//   path    16 e3  THE RIFF, bass-only lockstep with kick, snare on 3
//   assault 16 e4  + string stabs answering in the riff's gaps
//   hold    8  e2  riff stops mid-bar and never returns — choir holds
//   path2   8  e4  the riff comes back an octave up, hats join
//   outro   8  e1  choir + drone; one last riff hit rings out
// hook: the stop-riff, answered in its own silences — path/assault/path2.

setbpm(92);

"<intro@2 path@4 assault@4 hold@2 path2@2 outro@2>".slow(4).pickRestart({
  intro: stack(
